@startuml
!include _theme.iuml

title C4 Deployment — Baseline distribuída P6
left to right direction

C4Person(operator, "Platform operator", "Monitora filas, DLQ e autoriza replay.")

node "Developer Workstation\n[Docker Compose]" as workstation {
  node "API and Workflow Zone" as appzone {
    artifact "Distributed API\n[FastAPI]" as api
    artifact "Outbox Publisher" as outbox
    artifact "Workflow Worker" as workflow
    artifact "Timer Worker" as timer
    artifact "OPA" as opa
  }

  node "Durable Baseline State" as datazone {
    database "SQLite\nCases + Timeline + Outbox + Inbox + Timers + DLQ" as sqlite
  }

  node "Event Backbone" as eventzone {
    queue "Redpanda / Kafka\nbackoffice.events.v1" as events
    queue "DLQ Topic\nbackoffice.dlq.v1" as dlq
  }
}

operator --> api : operational API / controlled replay
api --> opa : policy decision
api --> sqlite : case command + timeline transaction
sqlite --> outbox : claim pending outbox
outbox --> events : publish keyed by caseId
workflow --> events : consume with durable group
workflow --> sqlite : inbox + projection + state effect
workflow --> dlq : failed after retry budget
timer --> sqlite : claim due timers and emit timeline event
api --> sqlite : inspect outbox, timers and dead letters

note bottom of workstation
At-least-once delivery and idempotent consumption.
Single-node Redpanda and SQLite are local baseline choices only.
end note
@enduml
